  "source_scope_note": "The selected problem is Theorem 3.1 on a closed connected quantizable Kahler manifold with the exact positive holomorphic prequantum curvature, Liouville L2 and Rawnsley probability normalization. For each fixed eigenvalue index, the authored Laplacian approximation and smooth subsequential eigenfunction convergence are selected; no uniform-in-index estimate is claimed. The complete author body retains all local kernel, Sobolev, min-max, multiplicity and compactness arguments. Named Bergman/heat asymptotics remain explicit standard references; later quantum-channel, Donaldson-iteration and other applications are unselected context.",
